Subject: [PATCH 1/2] docs(process): classify-effort skill - one way to choose
 an issue's effort label

Adds .claude/skills/classify-effort/: classify one issue, sweep the open
issues that have no effort label, or audit existing labels read-only.
It applies AGENTS.md's effort table and safety floor, weighs the work that
is left (the next bounded stage of an umbrella, not the whole programme),
and never lowers a label - only the maintainer does.

AGENTS.md "Set at filing" points at the skill. PROCESS_VERSION 11 -> 12.

